        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luca Brecel, Shaun Murphy\n- Events: 2017 China Championship\n- Topics: snooker achievements, playing style\n\nFacts:\n- In 2017, Luca Brecel became the first player from mainland Europe to win a ranking event by defeating Shaun Murphy in the final of the China Championship.\n- Shaun Murphy is nicknamed \"The Magician.\"\n- Shaun Murphy is noted for his straight cue action and his long potting.",
